{% extends "app.njk" %}
{% set title = "Call review" %}
{% set active = "call-review" %}
{% set bodyClass = "p-quality" %}
{% block content %}
    <header class="page-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Nour · Quality analyst agent</p>
      <h1>Call review</h1>
      <p class="lede">Upload a call recording. The fine-tuned WavLM emotion model listens to it and shows how the caller felt, moment by moment.</p>
      <p class="head-actions"><span class="badge cov live">Real model, not demo data</span></p>
    </header>

    <section class="panel" aria-labelledby="up">
      <h2 id="up">Recording</h2>
      <form id="review-form" data-csrf="{{ csrf }}">
        <label for="audio">Audio file (wav, mp3, ogg, flac; up to 15 MB, first 2 minutes are scored)</label>
        <input id="audio" type="file" accept="audio/*" required>
        <audio id="player" controls hidden></audio>
        <p><button type="submit" class="btn">Analyze emotion</button></p>
      </form>
      <p id="review-status" role="status" class="muted"></p>
    </section>

    <section class="panel" id="review-result" aria-labelledby="rs" hidden>
      <h2 id="rs">Result</h2>
      <p class="review-main"><strong id="r-emotion"></strong> <span class="muted" id="r-detail"></span></p>
      <h3>Through the call</h3>
      <ol class="emo-timeline" id="r-timeline"></ol>
      <div id="r-why-box" hidden>
        <h3>Why this answer</h3>
        <p class="muted" id="r-why-lead"></p>
        <ol class="emo-why" id="r-why" aria-label="How much each part of the recording mattered to the answer"></ol>
        <div class="emo-why-axis muted"><span>0 s</span><span id="r-why-end"></span></div>
        <p class="emo-why-legend"><span class="sw for"></span> the model leaned on this part <span class="sw against"></span> this part argued against the answer</p>
        <p id="r-why-top"></p>
        <p class="muted">How this was found: the app silences one short block of the recording at a time and scores the clip again with the same model. A block whose removal makes the answer less likely is a block the model leaned on. It shows where the model looked, not why it is right.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="muted">Trained on acted speech (CREMA-D, RAVDESS) with phone-line effects added. Real calls may be harder; sad is its weakest emotion. See the model card in <code>models/</code>.</p>
    </section>
{% endblock %}
